{
  "schema": "fablereborn.raid-node",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "The Titan's Gaze",
  "description": "Tank/healer/damage boss with role selection. Vanguards (2 slots, 300 HP) are the Titan's only targets; Hold the Line halves incoming damage. Menders (2 slots) Mend the lowest hero or Renew all Vanguards. Strikers gain Fury each round and spend 3 to Sunder (+25% damage taken per stack, up to 4). Earthsplitter hits everyone every 3rd round, with a warning the round before. If every Vanguard is down, Sweeping Gaze hits the whole raid each round. At 30% HP the Titan enrages (+60% damage). Its stone-skin shield scales with party size. 18-round limit. Next: Titan felled. Failure: time runs out.",
  "entry": "titan_approach",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "titan_approach",
      "kind": "scene",
      "title": "The Titan Wakes",
      "text": "The mountain stands up.\n\nA **Stone Titan** turns its burning gaze on the raid. It will only strike those who stand in front of it... for now.\n\n🛡️ **Vanguards** (max 2, 300 HP): the Titan only attacks you. **Hold the Line** to halve the damage.\n💚 **Menders** (max 2): keep the Vanguards standing with **Renew**, and heal the raid after each Earthsplitter.\n⚔️ **Strikers**: deal damage, and spend Fury to **Sunder** its stone skin.\n\nIf every Vanguard falls, the Titan's **Sweeping Gaze** turns on everyone.",
      "next": "titan_battle",
      "rules": []
    },
    {
